## 4. **ROOT CAUSE (Reported Symptoms)**

Comparing the data extracted from the terminal with Microsoft's official documentation for Microsoft 365 and Microsofft Teams (https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/office/system-requirements/system-requirements-for-microsoft-365-for-business-education-and-government-use)

* **Processor and Storage:** The CPU (Ryzen 7 at 3.40 GHz) and available disk space (71.9 GB free) are well above the minimum requirements, ruling out these components as primary causes of the system slowness.

* **RAM**: The system has 4 G  of RAM, which is exactly the minimum requirement for running Windows 10 and Microsoft 365 independently. When video calls in Teams are performed simultaneously with spreadsheets and the Microsoft Edge browser, physical memory reaches 100% utilization, forcing the system to rely on disk paging and resulting in system freezes.

