## 5. **CORRECTIVE ACTIONS PERFORMED**

### 5.1 **Software Optimization and System Maintenance (PowerShell)**

An automated PowerShell maintenance routine was executed to remove log files, cache files, and prefetch data:

> Remove-Item -Path "$env:TEMP\*" -Recurse -Force -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue

> Remove-Item -Path "C:\Windows\Temp\*" -Recurse -Force -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue

> Remove-Item -Path "C:\Windows\Prefetch\*" -Recurse -Force -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue

<img width="1023" height="768" alt="powershellscriptcommand" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/28a56c53-d9f7-422c-a15d-5e099c54361c" />

### 5.2 **Physical RAM Upgrade (Hardware)**

Thw workstation was powered off and underwent a hardware upgrade, increasing the installed memory from **4,096 MB (4 GB) to 8,192 MB (8GB).**

